Side Note: Would it be possible/beneficial for us to create a non-crashing comparison operator for COORDs/points? It would look something like this:
```c++
bool operator<= (const COORD &c1, const COORD &c2)
{
    return c1.X <= c2.X && c1.Y <= c2.Y;
}
```
My main concern would be that it would cause some confusion with `CompareInBounds`, but this is just a thought.

